WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.545
It's here!

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.671
Dear Snoopy,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.381
Thank you for your application,

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:09.843
but you do not meet
our qualifications.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.558
Being an astronaut really
means a lot to you, huh.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:19.102
Then why let a little
failure get in your way?

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.770
Why don't we help you?

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:21.980
Woah!

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.274
Let's get this beagle
into space.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.109
Astronauts need to be curious,

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.403
Intelligent,

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.321
And courageous.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.286
I admire your
determination Snoopy.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.748
My dog, in space!

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.835
Hooray!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.715
Uh oh.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.966
Good grief.

